      "comment": "BRUTAL EDGE (3) was a useful 18.81 winner of a Grade 5 at Temora last start. Hot win latest and looks the one to beat again. BLUE SWALLOW (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when eighth at Temora over 457m behind Curtis Keeping (26.90) in a Grade 5. Can figure in the finish. CAWBOURNE TIFF (2) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at this track over 525m behind Magnificent (31.22) in a Grade 5. Can measure up this time. PAY RUBY (5) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage a nose away in second (23.12). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Well placed and gets her chance.",
